RangeMelee is a lightweight addon that automatically switches your action bar page based on:

  -  Whether you are in melee range or ranged range of your target.



Features

    Automatic action bar paging:

     -  Page 1: Default (ranged or no target).

     -  Page 2: Melee range.


    Auto-detects ranged weapon slot from your action bar textures.

    Default enabled for new characters.



Usage

The addon is active by default. It automatically:

   - Detects your ranged weapon slot.

   - Monitors your target and combat state.

   - Switches your action bar page when conditions change.

You can configure it using slash commands.



Slash Commands

All commands start with /rm:

/rm help
/rm status
/rm on
/rm off
/rm page default 1
/rm page melee 2
